{"id": "t136-001", "text": "Laila - 20 wks pregnant!! due early March. scan went fine, it's a girl. her mum already knitting and her dad's already planning a christening at their old church back in Cork, sometime next autumn. Laila wants something low key, he wants the whole works. her husband Marcus staying out of it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening at their old church back in Cork", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next autumn", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants something low key", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants the whole works", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}]}
